direction_1184 = location "Booro" about "Buro" found "Karus Eslant" karus at 851 907 in zone 11

On available
    Say "Master, It's said that something strange is going on in Eslant. Please go to [Ascetic] Veda and ask."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Nights here in Eslant are getting more and more fearful. Citizens here are suffering from a monster in their dreams every night..."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Given the shape of the monster, I suspect it's a Buro, a monster living in the northeastern part of the forest. They're said to be capable of real magic, but who knows? If they're the real cause of the nightmares, they should be removed..."

On in_progress
    Say "Where's the end of the nightmares..."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_1184

On ready
    Say "Eslant is not suffering from nightmares any more, is it?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "After you got rid of the Buro, no one is suffering from nightmares any more. Thank you!"
